WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,800
Taking care of housework really looks up to you

2
00:00:02,040 --> 00:00:05,120
When I open a company in the future, I must recruit a beautiful secretary of this level.

3
00:00:05,640 --> 00:00:08,960
Look how beautiful you are, do you want me to give you a pinch?

4
00:00:09,720 --> 00:00:12,280
It's okay. I can't ask for it. It's beautiful.

5
00:00:12,540 --> 00:00:13,560
This girl has gone to ask for help

6
00:00:20,540 --> 00:00:22,080
Such a noble and beautiful woman

7
00:00:22,580 --> 00:00:24,640
Is this the legendary top socialite?

8
00:00:26,270 --> 00:00:29,350
Dear bosses, welcome to visit this boss from afar

9
00:00:29,610 --> 00:00:31,130
This is the Mr. Zhang Tong I mentioned

10
00:00:31,390 --> 00:00:32,670
Top private treasure hunter

11
00:00:32,930 --> 00:00:34,970
My piece of gold nugget handed down from ancient times was his handiwork

12
00:00:35,170 --> 00:00:37,790
Yesterday, he also cut out 50 million yuan on the spot according to the guarantee.

13
00:00:38,050 --> 00:00:39,570
This is Boss Zhao from Zhao Guo Jewelry

14
00:00:39,830 --> 00:00:41,370
This is Boss Qin from Qin Dynasty Jewelry

15
00:00:41,630 --> 00:00:43,410
This is Mr. Luo, the man of mountains and rivers.

16
00:00:45,050 --> 00:00:47,350
My eyesight is so old at such a young age

17
00:00:47,610 --> 00:00:48,890
It's really a life-threatening situation

18
00:00:49,150 --> 00:00:50,430
Miss Fan makes treasures herself

19
00:00:50,690 --> 00:00:52,230
Mr. Zhang’s name is like thunder in our ears

20
00:00:52,490 --> 00:00:53,490
Specially brought today
